 "subject": "Add Gravity Garage Godot 4 game for iPhone",
 "body": "Physics driving game built in Godot 4.7: endless procedural terrain,\n3 planets (Dust Mesa, Moon Quarry, Glacier Run), 3 vehicles with\ngroove/spring suspension, upgrades, fuel and coins, flip bonuses,\nbreak-apart crashes with a ragdoll driver, daily seeded run, and a\nnotch-safe touch HUD with gas/brake pedals.\n\nIncludes the iOS export preset, a deploy-iphone.sh script that\nexports, signs, installs and launches on a connected iPhone, and the\noriginal HTML web prototype.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
